              "<table ><tr><th>title</th><td>Q4 2025 Sales Data Analysis – Key Insights Summary</td></tr><tr><th>columns</th><td><ul><li>Category</li><li>Metric / Topic</li><li>Value / Detail</li><li>Observation</li><li>Recommended Action</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th>rows</th><td><ul><li><ul><li>Regional Performance</li><li>North America Revenue Growth</li><li>+18%</li><li>Strong performance</li><li>None</li></ul></li><li><ul><li>Regional Performance</li><li>Europe Revenue Growth</li><li>+12%</li><li>Steady but potentially slowing vs. peers</li><li>Investigate if slowdown vs. peers is a concern</li></ul></li><li><ul><li>Regional Performance</li><li>Asia-Pacific Revenue Growth</li><li>+25%</li><li>Fastest growing region — standout growth engine</li><li>Increase regional investment &amp; headcount</li></ul></li><li><ul><li>Product Performance</li><li>Cloud Platform</li><li>Highest revenue tier</li><li>Revenue leader; platform-first strategy; concentration risk</li><li>Accelerate cross-sell of Security + Analytics</li></ul></li><li><ul><li>Product Performance</li><li>Security Suite</li><li>Secondary revenue stream</li><li>Important but secondary to Cloud Platform</li><li>None</li></ul></li><li><ul><li>Product Performance</li><li>Analytics</li><li>Secondary revenue stream</li><li>Important but secondary to Cloud Platform</li><li>None</li></ul></li><li><ul><li>Customer Retention</li><li>Churn Rate</li><li>5.8% → 4.2% (−27.6% improvement)</li><li>Most significant metric; improves LTV, reduces CAC pressure, signals product-market fit</li><li>Identify what drove this — replicate it</li></ul></li><li><ul><li>Enterprise Momentum</li><li>New Enterprise Contracts</li><li>145 new contracts above ARR threshold</li><li>Strong upmarket motion; higher retention, expansion revenue, brand credibility</li><li>Build dedicated enterprise success programs</li></ul></li></ul></td></tr><tr><th>notes</th><td>Revenue figures in the source dataset contain formatting errors (e.g., &#x27;.1B&#x27;, &#x27;.4B&#x27;, &#x27;M&#x27; without leading digits). Dollar-level values are incomplete and should not be used for precise calculations. Please resubmit data with complete revenue figures for accurate revenue mix percentages, deal size averages, and growth projections.</td></tr></table>",
