                  snippet:
                    "A-LIGN is the leading provider of high-quality, efficient cybersecurity compliance programs. Combining experienced auditors and audit management technology, A-LIGN provides the widest breadth and depth of services including SOC 2, ISO 27001, ...\nAs the Channel Account Manager, you will evaluate business opportunities, build strong partner relationships, and secure internal alignment through clear written documentation, all while managing multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment. A‑LIGN will depend on you to leverage your experience and network within the IT and cybersecurity partner ecosystem to help establish a strong foundation for long-term program growth.\nThis is a role for someone who has built and run field marketing programs at scale with deep experience working alongside partner ecosystems and who is equally comfortable presenting an event strategy to executive leadership then personally running a sponsored tradeshow booth the following week.\nA-LIGN is the leading provider of high-quality, efficient cybersecurity compliance programs. Combining experienced auditors and audit management technology, A-LIGN provides the widest breadth and depth of services including SOC 2, ISO 27001, HITRUST, FedRAMP, and PCI.",
