                    "Comp AI raises $2.6m to transform SOC 2 compliance with AI. Discover how the startup plans to disrupt the GRC market\nSince its stealth launch in April 2025, Comp AI has attracted 3,500 companies to its pre-launch testing and helped early users save over 2,500 hours on manual compliance work, it said.\nThe US insurance distribution ecosystem is one of the largest and most complex financial services networks in the world.\nSynctera has acquired Cable, a compliance control testing and verification specialist, in a move designed to strengthen regulatory oversight across the fintech ecosystem.",
