                    "Keeping you up to date about SEC staff positions on reporting matters and proposed rulemaking that will affect registrants ... In-depth analysis, examples and insights to give you an advantage in understanding the requirements and implications ...\nSubscribe to receive our newsletter, accounting and financial reporting updates and opportunities for CPE-eligible webcasts. We're sorry, the server is taking too long to respond, so the form could not be sent. Please try again later. Return to your form · All fields with an asterisk (*) are required. Access our accounting research website for additional resources for your financial reporting needs.\nKeeping you up to date about SEC staff positions on reporting matters and proposed rulemaking that will affect registrants ... In-depth analysis, examples and insights to give you an advantage in understanding the requirements and implications of financial reporting issues.\nIn this webcast, KPMG professionals discuss major developments that may affect a company’s accounting and financial reporting in the current period and near term.\nKPMG guidance and articles for financial reporting professionals.",
