              text: "# MLOps Risk Assessment\n\n## Critical Risks\n\n| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Priority |\n|------|-----------|--------|----------|\n| Model drift/degradation in production | High | High | **Critical** |\n| Data pipeline failures | High | High | **Critical** |\n| Security vulnerabilities in model endpoints | Medium | High | **Critical** |\n\n## Operational Risks\n\n- **Versioning inconsistencies** — mismatched data/model versions producing unreliable outputs\n- **Automated deployment failures** — CI/CD errors pushing broken models to production\n- **Monitoring blind spots** — inadequate alerting masking performance degradation\n- **Single points of failure** — insufficient redundancy in pipeline architecture\n\n## Organizational Risks\n\n- **Skill gaps** — teams lacking expertise across both ML and DevOps domains\n- **Governance failures** — unclear ownership of model accountability\n- **Technical debt accumulation** — rapid iteration without documentation standards\n\n## Data-Specific Risks\n\n- **Training/serving skew** — production data diverging from training distribution\n- **Data quality degradation** — upstream changes corrupting model inputs\n- **Compliance exposure** — inadequate lineage tracking for regulated industries\n\n## Key Recommendations\n\n1. **Implement automated drift detection** with defined rollback triggers\n2. **Establish clear model ownership** with documented accountability chains\n3. **Enforce end-to-end lineage tracking** across data and model versions\n4. **Conduct regular adversarial testing** of model endpoints\n\n---\n**Would you like deeper analysis on any specific risk category?**",
