                    "# Robert Alexe  \n**Solution Architect | Software Developer | People Manager | AWS Practice Lead**  \n- **Management Level:** Senior  \nApplication Architect and Software Developer with expertise in cloud-native design, implementation of Java microservices and big data architectures. Experienced people manager focused on building high-performing engineering teams and delivering scalable enterprise solutions.\n### Java Software Engineer at IBM · Bucharest (2014-08-01 – 2024-05-01)\n**Specialist**  \nJava Software Engineer specialised in baking sector, responsible for designing and implementing modern web applications and scalable 3-tier architectures. Develops robust microservices using best practices in Domain-Driven Design (DDD), ensuring clean boundaries, maintainability, and high performance. Collaborates with cross-functional teams to deliver secure, reliable, and user-centric solutions across the full software development lifecycle.\n## Skills\nconsulting, user-centric approach, aws, operations management, architect, application developer, solutions architect, software development, modernization, architectural design, technical skills, enterprise solution, roadmap development, french, managing business, big data, technical team leadership, java microservices, implementation, cross-functional, architectures, application architecture, cloud migration, management, cloud infrastructure, program management, cross-functional teams, infrastructure, enhancements, collaboration, migration, practice lead, design, java, engineering, mentoring, ibm technologies proficiency, best practices, developer, enterprise software, coaching, lead development, technical lead, teams, designing, domain-driven design, banking sector, leading, people management, web applications, clean, java full-stack, web development, software developer, leadership, vehicle leasing, information system, across, agile, microservices, managing, assessment, baking, cloud-native, career development, java enterprise, engineer, solutioning, technical assessment, scale, user-centric solutions, data, development, testing, cloud computing, documenting, software engineering, guiding, banking operations, leasing, team lead, full-stack development, banking, working together, experienced people manager",
