                  text: "## Q4 2025 Quarterly Business Report Summary\n\n**Financial Performance**\n- Revenue reached **$4.2 billion**, up 15% year-over-year\n- Operating margin improved to **28%** (up from 24% in Q3)\n- Customer acquisition costs dropped **12%** due to better marketing efficiency\n\n**Growth Highlights**\n- Active users grew 22% to **45 million**\n- Monthly recurring revenue hit **$350M**\n- Expanded into **3 new markets**: Southeast Asia, Eastern Europe, and South America\n\n**Other Key Metrics**\n- Net Promoter Score improved from 62 → **71**\n- Headcount grew to **8,500** employees across 12 global offices\n- R&D investment of **$840M** (20% of revenue)\n\n**Q1 2026 Outlook**\n- Revenue projected between **$4.4B–$4.6B**\n- Key initiatives: AI analytics platform launch, partner ecosystem expansion, and SOC 2 Type II certification\n\nOverall, the company demonstrated strong growth across revenue, users, and operational efficiency while positioning itself for continued expansion in 2026.",
