            data_html:
              "Subject: Update on Your Application for VP, Enterprise Sales at ACME\n\nDear John,\n\nThank you for your interest in the Vice President, Enterprise Sales position at ACME and for taking the time to share your background with us. We genuinely appreciate the opportunity to review your application.\n\nAfter careful consideration, we have decided not to move forward with your candidacy for this particular role. This position requires 12+ years of progressive B2B sales experience, including at least 5 years in VP-level leadership, a proven track record of building and managing enterprise sales teams of 50+ professionals, and demonstrated success owning $100M+ ARR quotas selling SaaS solutions to Fortune 500 companies. After reviewing your CV, we found that your experience—primarily in retail sales and customer-facing roles, alongside your background in graphic design—does not align with the executive-level enterprise SaaS sales leadership requirements of this opportunity.\n\nThat said, your creative training and clearly stated passion for apparel and retail design are real strengths. We would encourage you to pursue roles that more closely match your graphic design expertise and your stated objective of designing apparel prints for an innovative retail company, where your talents are likely to shine.\n\nWe wish you tremendous success in your career and thank you again for considering ACME.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nThe ACME Talent Acquisition Team",
